            "text": "🚀Attention Startups Interested in the Hong Kong Market! \n \nAstana Hub invites you to the webinar, “Unlocking Opportunities in Hong Kong’s Tech Ecosystem: Insights from Cyberport.” \n \n 🗓 Date: 16 September \n  Time: 11.00 \n\nCyberport is Hong Kong’s hub for digital technology, fostering growth in FinTech, smart living, AI, and more. With strong government backing, it supports startups through programs that drive innovation and market expansion.\n\n🗣️ Billy Chung will share insights into the Hong Kong’s IT ecosystem, investment opportunities, and key players. \n\nDon’t miss this chance to explore Hong Kong’s tech landscape and gain valuable knowledge from local experts! Learn how Kazakh startups can secure funding and thrive in this dynamic market. \n\n🔗 Register via the link in the bio."
